  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile with scvi_n200 achieves 0.65 accuracy, but the role of image data remains unclear. This experiment tests image-only multiprofile with resnet50 (a strong image encoder) to isolate the impact of image data versus RNA data. It directly compares performance in a multiprofile setting, addressing uncertainty about whether image-only models can match RNA-only performance. This clarifies the importance of modality and profile settings, aligning with the principle of reducing uncertainty about key design choices."
}

